  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Artists' book which consists of 20 pieces of colored paper with an object attached. The papers are contained in a cardboard box with a metallic plate attached to the top which is inscribed with the title of the book "Rejunte."</subfield>
  </datafield>
